Further we also need Carrier, Thermoking, Daikin also to hv their official representation in Bahrain.
Both vendors hv experienced technicians, and had trainings from Dubai (from official agent of respective makers in Dubai).
If the exercise can be done once more and officially declare BAHBA vendors as official agent of respective makers (with ample/sufficient spare parts).
Then Bahrain too wud become a full fledged reefer handling terminal, (after AEJEA, AEKLF).

Have you taken up with Star cool on the shortage/in-sufficient spare part at AEAUH vendor (MECRC Abu Dhabi), whereby we experienced severe issue and had to incurr huge cost to safeguard the cargo (transporting mty from JEA trmnl to AUH trmnl to remove the spare).
