Good day Mr.Enrique



We recently started RFR O/B biz ex BHBAH.

U/stand PTI was passed, but after stuffing and dropping the cargo at Terminal on 24th. The unit developed malfunction on 25th AM (as below).

Its a "Star Cool Unit".



Could you take up with "Star Cool" on this issue.

Further u/stand "Star Cool" do not have an agent in BHBAH.

There are good RFR export biz ex BHBAH, but just because there are no official agent for Star Cool or sufficient spares; we cannot loose these biz.

APL/MSC is already scooping good RFR O/B biz from BHBAH, and we want to compete with them and score more O/B RFR biz for backhaul high rev cgo.



cc: BAHBA ric - Pls compile the related costs. Restict the costs as much as possible, as discussed.



cc: PUSBTE ric - We need yr assistance to have Reefer kit at BHBAH for all four types of reefer Brands at BHBAH.  We hv discussed with BHBAH trmnl management two days ago (during our meeting at JEA), who promised to hv it stored under their premises under our vendors care/stock/custody.   We need to have it, to protect our interest and to compete with APL and to assure our Shipper on the seriousness HJS is extending to get their increased O/B support.



Thanking you in advance.



